    ],
    "text": "Governor Jay Inslee"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000020",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0001-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "Of\ufb01ce of the Governor"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000021",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0002-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "PO Box 40002"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000022",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0003-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "Olympia, WA 98504-0002"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000023",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0004-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "Dear Governor Inslee:"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000024",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0005-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0005-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0005-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0005-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0005-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0005-l0003"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0005-l0003",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0005-l0004"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0005-l0000",
      "p0002-n0005-l0001",
      "p0002-n0005-l0002",
      "p0002-n0005-l0003",
      "p0002-n0005-l0004"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "I write to you on behalf of the MCM team 55583. We are extremely concerned about the traf\ufb01c condition in the Great Seattle area. Investigation shows that the traf\ufb01c \ufb02ow usually exceeds the traf\ufb01c capacity in many regions in the Great Seattle, especially during peak hours. We hope to help you improve the traf\ufb01c conditions."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000025",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0006-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0006-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0006-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0006-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0006-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0006-l0003"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0006-l0003",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0006-l0004"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0006-l0004",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0006-l0005"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0006-l0000",
      "p0002-n0006-l0001",
      "p0002-n0006-l0002",
      "p0002-n0006-l0003",
      "p0002-n0006-l0004",
      "p0002-n0006-l0005"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "The current traf\ufb01c condition could lead to many severe problems. The \ufb01rst problem is unacceptable delay during peak hours.During the morning commute and at the end of the day these delays become extreme long. Also it could lead to congested roads, and potentially increase the probability of occurrence of traf\ufb01c accidents. Congested roads could also cause problems for emergency vehicles, making them unable to respond in an appropriate amount of time."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000026",
    "issues": [
      "hyphen_join_review"
    ],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0007-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0007-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0007-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0007-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0007-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0007-l0003"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0007-l0000",
      "p0002-n0007-l0001",
      "p0002-n0007-l0002",
      "p0002-n0007-l0003"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "After an in-depth study of the traf\ufb01c conditions in the Great Seattle area, we have come up with some ideas that can help address this issue. We propose self- driving, cooperating cars as a solution to increase the traf\ufb01c capacity without building extra lanes."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000027",
    "issues": [
      "hyphen_join_review"
    ],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0008-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0008-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0008-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0008-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0008-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0008-l0003"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0008-l0003",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0008-l0004"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0008-l0004",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0008-l0005"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0008-l0000",
      "p0002-n0008-l0001",
      "p0002-n0008-l0002",
      "p0002-n0008-l0003",
      "p0002-n0008-l0004",
      "p0002-n0008-l0005"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "Compared to human-drived cars, self-driving cars have many advantages. The biggest advantage is that it take much less time to react in terms of emer- gency. This actually allows self-driving cars to keep a closer distance with the car in front of it, thus it takes up much less traf\ufb01c resource. In addition to this, self driving cars can tune their acceleration and deceleration pro\ufb01les to consume less fuel."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000028",
    "issues": [
      "hyphen_join_review"
    ],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0009-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0009-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0009-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0009-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0009-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0009-l0003"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0009-l0003",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0009-l0004"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0009-l0004",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0009-l0005"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0009-l0005",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0009-l0006"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0009-l0006",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0009-l0007"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0009-l0007",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0009-l0008"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0009-l0000",
      "p0002-n0009-l0001",
      "p0002-n0009-l0002",
      "p0002-n0009-l0003",
      "p0002-n0009-l0004",
      "p0002-n0009-l0005",
      "p0002-n0009-l0006",
      "p0002-n0009-l0007",
      "p0002-n0009-l0008"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "Those advantages mentioned above make self-driving cars an excellent choice for addressing heavy traf\ufb01c load. We build a model to simulate the traf\ufb01c \ufb02ow of the most busy roads in the Great Seattle area and evaluate the effectiveness of self-driving cars addressing the problem of heavy traf\ufb01c load. The simula- tion shows promising results. The introduction of self-driving cars makes all cars among all roads in the Great Seattle area go faster, it works especially well among busy roads during traf\ufb01c peak hours. When no self-driving cars are in- troduced, the traf\ufb01c goes very slow during peak hours, but after introducing approximately 50% self-driving cars the traf\ufb01c \ufb02ow goes 1.5 2 times faster."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000029",
    "issues": [
      "hyphen_join_review"
    ],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0010-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0010-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0010-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0010-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0002-n0010-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0002-n0010-l0003"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0010-l0000",
      "p0002-n0010-l0001",
      "p0002-n0010-l0002",
      "p0002-n0010-l0003"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "In addition to making traf\ufb01c \ufb02ow faster, self-driving cars also make traf\ufb01c \ufb02ow more stable. From our simulation, we observed that introduction of self- driving cars help to reduce the variance of traf\ufb01c delay. This is important because it helps to estimate times, and helps to reduce \"just in case\" time."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000030",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "merged_block_id": "b000031",
        "operation": "cross_page_join_candidate"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0003-n0000-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0003-n0000-l0001"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0002-n0011-l0000",
      "p0003-n0000-l0000",
      "p0003-n0000-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2,
      3
    ],
    "text": "For the above reasons, we propose self-driving cars as a solution to heavy traf\ufb01c load in the Great Seattle. We appreciate all that you do for this city, and we look forward to seeing positive changes. We hope you can accept out advices."
  }
]
